  "description": "Enya Valencia, dreaded master of the enchanted Hexenkeep of Morgenda, has a new enemy - the celebrated knight of radiance, Helios. The hatred is mutual, but so is their fate of certain death... unless they meet one condition: they must sleep with each other.\n\n *\"...Shall we start by kissing, hexenkeeper?\"*\n\nSo begins their spiteful romance - at the pinnacle of carnal affection. \n\n(Source: Pocket Comics)\n\n*Note: First released in English, with the initial eligible release in Japanese followed by Korean, making it a manga by our standards.*",
